---
description: Onboarding app dropdowns must use bottom sheets
globs: **/*.dart
alwaysApply: true
---

# Dropdowns = bottom sheets

- Do not use `DropdownButton` / `DropdownButtonFormField` / `DropdownMenu` for field selection.
- Use `BottomSheetSelectField` (or `showOptionBottomSheet`) from `lib/core/widgets/ui_kit.dart`.
- Scan success must play beep via `SoundService().playScanBeep()` (same asset as troskit_app).
